                "message": "Fix litnote title surname for \"Last, First M.\" names\n\nThe particle test in sp-litnotes-titles--split-name ran with case-fold-search\non, so an initial such as \"J.\" counted as a lower-case particle and the\ntitle became \"J. Arthur\". Match case-sensitively, split commas outside\nbraces, and add tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiATczu45nYqwaKie4g",
